'''Shy Boy''' (赤羅我王, ''Akara Gaō'') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] variant of [[The Face]] that appears in [[Into the Future]], [[Cats of the Cosmos]], [[The Aku Realms]], and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]].

