==Trivia==
*His Japanese name, Akara Gaō (赤羅我王), or Gaō Akara as it would be in languages where surnames come second, is a pun on the word ''akaragao'' (赤ら顔), meaning "reddened face". It's made to sound more like a proper name by being spelled using only kanji, specifically the ones for "red" (赤), "lightweight fabric" (羅), "ego" or "self-assertion" (我) and "king" (王). Gaō (我王) is also a pun on ''kao'' (顔), meaning "face".
*He is the first enemy to have multiple traits.
*He has a lower ID than [[The Face]] despite appearing later.
*The flaming Shy Boy variant from [[Nyanko Defence Force]] may have been inspired by [https://yokai.com/tsurubeotoshi/ tsurube otoshi], a giant head ''[[wikipedia:Yōkai|yōkai]]'' said to drop down on its prey from treetops and sometimes appear wreathed in flames like a large fireball.
*Shyboy from [[The Burgle Cats]] is a direct reference to him, having nearly the same name and a similar appearance.

